      EVALUATE: "evaluateAndAct() — periodically (called by scheduler), gathers world state, sends to Architect AI, parses interventions. Fires when ≥ 5 unprocessed events accumulate."
      SYNTHESIZE: "getArchitectContext() — builds formatted text blocks: epoch info, faction standings, key fragment progress, tension, recent events, narrative themes."
